{
  "summary": "This experiment tested a multimodal multiprofile model combining scvi_n200 (RNA) and imagenet_vit_l (image) encoders with transformer aggregation, achieving validation accuracy of 0.7207. The result suggests multimodal integration may improve performance compared to RNA-only baselines, but the exact contribution of the image encoder versus other factors like aggregation remains uncertain. Further experiments are needed to isolate the impact of specific encoders and fusion strategies."
}

